2.6.23-rc3.

The following behavior is new to 2.6.23-rcX, and I don't think it's
related to "aboot"...  I have the bootlogo code enabled, and at some
point during the system startup, the logo disappears (expected) and
the virtual console switches from tty1 to tty2 (unexpected).  I can
switch back to tty1, so other than the unexpected console switch,
there doesn't seem to be anything "unfortunate" happening.  Is anyone
else seeing this?

